    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Spirit Guardians is a pixel-art, roguelike game that blends elements of role-playing, strategy, tower defense, real-time strategy, and shooting. Farming gears, upgrading skills, unlocking new talents\u2026the game offers a continuous journey of empowerment, challenging relentless foes to protect the peace of the Spirit Realm!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Guardian</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/aad8aed2e7d35537684b7b5231fd1538.poster.avif?t=1739409765\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/aad8aed2e7d35537684b7b5231fd1538.webm?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/aad8aed2e7d35537684b7b5231fd1538.mp4?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>To safeguard the Spirit Realm, you must repel invading evil spirits and defend the spiritual energy crystals. Utilize traps, activate sigils, cast spells, and fight alongside allies to preserve the last hope.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Powerup</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/e58fcf2019e79e1aa9620e30506e6f76.poster.avif?t=1739409765\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/e58fcf2019e79e1aa9620e30506e6f76.webm?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/e58fcf2019e79e1aa9620e30506e6f76.mp4?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defeat swarms of enemies, absorb soul orbs, level up, and choose skills. Collect soul stones, unlock talents, and gain permanent enhancements. Spend coins to strengthen your unlocked skills. Only through constant growth can you stand against the onslaught of the evil spirit army.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gear Up </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/495992f363ae50540192cee853cacd21.poster.avif?t=1739409765\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/495992f363ae50540192cee853cacd21.webm?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/495992f363ae50540192cee853cacd21.mp4?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defeat elite enemies, open chests, choose the desired gears, and upgrade through synthesis. Dress in equipment according to your combat style to craft the strongest warrior uniquely yours!\uff01<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Legion of Evil Spirits </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/cb3295bd516923c55c104f527e1423d9.poster.avif?t=1739409765\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/cb3295bd516923c55c104f527e1423d9.webm?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/cb3295bd516923c55c104f527e1423d9.mp4?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the Spirit Realm, justice and evil are intertwined. Incarnate as an evil spirit, defeat guardians, corrupt spiritual energy crystals\u2014various gameplay experiences await.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Formidable Foes </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/9b490e4a991d0eb3151093c4d37879fa.poster.avif?t=1739409765\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/9b490e4a991d0eb3151093c4d37879fa.webm?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/9b490e4a991d0eb3151093c4d37879fa.mp4?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Within the legion of evil spirits, powerful individuals exist. You must give your all or face defeat. Death is not the end; you can utilize mysterious powers to resurrect, but miracles come at a cost\u2026<br><br>Challenge enemies, collect gears, and upgrade skills in gradually unlocked campaigns, or conquer opponents in the arena to prove you might. Are you ready to delve into the Spirit Realm? Your battle begins now in Spirit Guardians!",
    "about_the_game": "Spirit Guardians is a pixel-art, roguelike game that blends elements of role-playing, strategy, tower defense, real-time strategy, and shooting. Farming gears, upgrading skills, unlocking new talents\u2026the game offers a continuous journey of empowerment, challenging relentless foes to protect the peace of the Spirit Realm!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Guardian</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/aad8aed2e7d35537684b7b5231fd1538.poster.avif?t=1739409765\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/aad8aed2e7d35537684b7b5231fd1538.webm?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/aad8aed2e7d35537684b7b5231fd1538.mp4?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>To safeguard the Spirit Realm, you must repel invading evil spirits and defend the spiritual energy crystals. Utilize traps, activate sigils, cast spells, and fight alongside allies to preserve the last hope.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Powerup</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/e58fcf2019e79e1aa9620e30506e6f76.poster.avif?t=1739409765\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/e58fcf2019e79e1aa9620e30506e6f76.webm?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/e58fcf2019e79e1aa9620e30506e6f76.mp4?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defeat swarms of enemies, absorb soul orbs, level up, and choose skills. Collect soul stones, unlock talents, and gain permanent enhancements. Spend coins to strengthen your unlocked skills. Only through constant growth can you stand against the onslaught of the evil spirit army.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gear Up </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/495992f363ae50540192cee853cacd21.poster.avif?t=1739409765\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/495992f363ae50540192cee853cacd21.webm?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/495992f363ae50540192cee853cacd21.mp4?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defeat elite enemies, open chests, choose the desired gears, and upgrade through synthesis. Dress in equipment according to your combat style to craft the strongest warrior uniquely yours!\uff01<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Legion of Evil Spirits </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/cb3295bd516923c55c104f527e1423d9.poster.avif?t=1739409765\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/cb3295bd516923c55c104f527e1423d9.webm?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/cb3295bd516923c55c104f527e1423d9.mp4?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the Spirit Realm, justice and evil are intertwined. Incarnate as an evil spirit, defeat guardians, corrupt spiritual energy crystals\u2014various gameplay experiences await.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Formidable Foes </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/9b490e4a991d0eb3151093c4d37879fa.poster.avif?t=1739409765\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/9b490e4a991d0eb3151093c4d37879fa.webm?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2742050/extras/9b490e4a991d0eb3151093c4d37879fa.mp4?t=1739409765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Within the legion of evil spirits, powerful individuals exist. You must give your all or face defeat. Death is not the end; you can utilize mysterious powers to resurrect, but miracles come at a cost\u2026<br><br>Challenge enemies, collect gears, and upgrade skills in gradually unlocked campaigns, or conquer opponents in the arena to prove you might. Are you ready to delve into the Spirit Realm? Your battle begins now in Spirit Guardians!",
